<title>SPAIN: Spain's Bankinter dividend rises 20.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Bankinter dividend rises 20.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish bank Bankinter said it was paying a second interim dividend on October 5 of 152 pesetas gross, 20.6 percent higher than the same payment last year.</p>
<p>The bank paid out a total 508 pesetas per share in gross dividends in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1  585 2151</p>
</text>
